{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "de784948-07d1-8257-bd4f-7def2e65cbdd",
  "created_at": "2026-01-07T10:57:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Priya Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:55:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:55:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Tony. This is Priya Abdi. Let me explain what's going on. I own a rental at 147 Ayrault Street, up on the Hill, and I just got the water and sewer bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:55:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. What's looking off about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:56:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's much higher than it should be. Last year's winter bills were much lower, like half of this. Same tenants, same everything. So I don't see why I'm paying this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:56:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. Do you know if the reading on the bill was an actual reading or an estimate? It'll say right by the meter numbers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:56:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It says actual. I looked. I'm not saying the meter is lying, I'm saying the number is wrong to me. I'd like someone to recheck it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:56:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I can put in a request for a meter re-read and a look at the usage history. Can I get a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:56:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 401-555-0184."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:56:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0184. I'll note it on the account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:56:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Also, I'm a senior myself, and I'm wondering, is there any discount for low-income or elderly households? Even if it's just for my own place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:56:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There may be something along those lines. I'll have the billing office send you the details on what's available and how to apply, since it depends on the household."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:56:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. And one more thing. It's almost eleven now, but I'm often home late in the day. Can the website take a card payment right now, or only during office hours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:57:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The website takes payments any hour, day or night. There's also a drop box outside City Hall if you'd rather pay by check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:57:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll wait on paying until the re-read, though. Sorry, I'm looking at my half-finished sweater on the couch and I lost my place. Anything else you need?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:57:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all I need. You'll hear back from us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:57:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Tony. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
